becomes a propeller of 3.93 metres,
the nacelle opens, and we keep

198
00:15:19.993 --> 00:15:23.761
the core flow, the low pressure
turbine pressure ratio and, as the

199
00:15:23.801 --> 00:15:27.280
official solution does, the high
pressure compressor ratio of

200
00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:32.876
4.636, so the overall pressure
ratio drops from 30.6 to 5 times

201
00:15:32.916 --> 00:15:41.574
4.636, 23.2, with 1.70 bar after the
booster and 7.87 bar at the burner.

202
00:15:41.624 --> 00:15:44.862
Without the fan, the low
pressure compressor starts from

203
00:15:44.902 --> 00:15:49.721
the inlet temperature, so it
ends at 416.6 kelvin, the

204
00:15:49.761 --> 00:15:56.022
